## Preference for anchor-info-existing-object controlled-by.
sp {thor-soar*compare*anchor-info-existing-object*controlled-by
    :default
   (state <s> ^name thor-soar
              ^operator <op1> +
                        { <> <op1> <op2> }  +)
   (<op1> ^name anchor-info-existing-object
          ^controlled-by true)
   (<op2> ^name anchor-info-existing-object
         -^controlled-by true)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <op1> > <op2>)
}

